    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***NEWLY RENOVATED / OWN DOOR / PRIVATE PARKING / PRIME LOCATION***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present to the market 21 Saddlers Court, Ardee Road, Rathmines, Dublin 6, a bright and spacious one-bedroom own-door apartment ideally positioned within this beautifully maintained gated development in the heart of Rathmines.\r\n\r\nRecently upgraded, No. 21 is presented in excellent condition and benefits from a newly fitted kitchen, newly fitted bathroom and new flooring throughout, creating a fresh and contemporary interior ready for its new owner to enjoy. The added benefit of its own private entrance and private parking further enhances the appeal of this superb apartment.\r\n\r\nOn entering, you are welcomed into a bright hallway with useful hot-press storage. The double bedroom is generously proportioned and features an excellent range of built-in wardrobes, providing ample storage while maintaining a clean and uncluttered feel.\r\n\r\nThe real heart of the home is the spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. Finished with attractive ceiling coving, the living space features a charming fireplace with marble surround, while large sliding doors flood the room with natural light and provide direct access to the private outdoor space. This is a wonderful extension of the living accommodation and offers an ideal spot for outdoor dining, potted plants or simply relaxing.\r\n\r\nThe newly fitted kitchen has been finished in a crisp contemporary style with white cabinetry, sleek worktops, tiled splashback and excellent storage and preparation space. The combination of the new kitchen and flooring gives the open-plan accommodation a particularly bright and modern finish.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is completed by the newly fitted bathroom, which has been finished to an excellent standard with striking marble-effect tiling, a modern white suite and bath with overhead shower.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none. Rathmines is one of Dublin’s most vibrant and sought-after neighbourhoods, offering an exceptional selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars, cinemas and everyday amenities. Dublin City Centre is within easy reach, while the neighbouring villages of Ranelagh, Rathgar and Terenure are all just minutes away.\r\n\r\nWith its own-door entrance, private parking, outdoor space and newly upgraded interior, No. 21 Saddlers Court is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing comes highly recommended."
